+// Scenario 26 — responsible gambling: limits a player sets, lowers, raises and removes, and the
+// operator's changes to them.
+//
+// Drives the casino-service routes the frontends use:
+//
+//	PUT/DELETE /v1/casino/rg/{brandId}/{playerId}/limits/{type}        (RgRoutes, player JWT)
+//	GET        /v1/casino/rg/{brandId}/{playerId}/limits               (RgRoutes, player JWT)
+//	PUT/DELETE /v1/casino/{brandId}/players/{playerId}/rg/limits/{type} (BackofficePlayerRoutes, operator JWT)
+//
+// Each test names the living-feature scenario it covers (ankka-casino features/responsible-gambling).
+// Where the original does not have the behaviour a scenario describes, the test (or the subtest
+// for that part) skips with "original defect: ..." so the gap is visible in the suite's result.
+//
+// This file also holds the rk* helpers shared by scenarios 26–29.
+//
+// Requires: EITHEROR_CASINO_URL (player and operator routes), Keycloak admin access for clearing
+// email verification on fresh players (EITHEROR_KEYCLOAK_URL, EITHEROR_KEYCLOAK_ADMIN_PASSWORD);
+// operator tests also need TEST_OPERATOR_EMAIL / TEST_OPERATOR_PASSWORD and skip without them.
+package e2e_test
